rin was one of the astronauts on the Apollo 11 mission and the second person to walk on the Moon.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Apollo 11\",\n      \"Conspiracy Theory\",\n      \"Moon Landing Hoax\",\n      \"Apollo 11 is the subject of a conspiracy theory that claims the moon landing was faked.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Apollo 11\",\n      \"Competitor\",\n      \"Soviet Union\",\n      \"The Soviet Union was the main competitor of the United States in the space race, which was a significant factor in the Apollo 11 mission.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Neil Armstrong\",\n      \"Participated In\",\n      \"Apollo 11 Mission\",\n      \"Neil Armstrong was one of the astronauts on the Apollo 11 mission, which was a significant achievement in the space race.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Neil Armstrong\",\n      \"Fellow Astronaut\",\n      \"Buzz Aldrin\",\n      \"Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin were both astronauts on the Apollo 11 mission and walked on the Moon together.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Neil Armstrong\",\n      \"Subject Of\",\n      \"Moon Landing Conspiracy Theory\",\n      \"Neil Armstrong, as one of the first astronauts to walk on the Moon, is a central figure in the conspiracy theory that the Moon landing was staged.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Oswald\",\n      \"Allegedly Involved In\",\n      \"Assassination of John F. Kennedy\",\n      \"Oswald is often cited as the alleged assassin of President John F. Kennedy, though some theories suggest he was a patsy.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Oswald\",\n      \"Associated With\",\n      \"CIA\",\n      \"Some conspiracy theories suggest that Oswald had connections with the CIA, possibly as part of a larger plot to assassinate President Kennedy.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Oswald\",\n      \"Associated With\",\n      \"Mafia\",\n      \"Some conspiracy theories propose that Oswald was involved with the Mafia, which may have played a role in the assassination of President Kennedy.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Pentagon\",\n    